            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is the first in a series of three articles outlining taping techniques on a regional basis. Where taping has a role in the management of an injury, the articles also describe appropriate site specific techniques. Further, taping of the more common conditions encountered in general practice are described.</AbstractText>
